[
  {
    "id": "vandikkaran-magan-s025-d001",
    "scene_id": "vandikkaran-magan-s025",
    "scene_ordinal": 25,
    "source_scene_id": "20-எ",
    "source_heading": "காட்சி-20-எ",
    "speaker_label": "கோகிலா",
    "source_delimiter": ":—",
    "source_scene_file": "scene-025.md",
    "page_provenance": [
      {
        "pdf_page": 37,
        "printed_page": 36
      }
    ],
    "text": "(மெய்மறந்த நிலையில் மரகதத்தின் கையைப் பிடித்தவாறு) விங்கன்!..."
  },
  {
    "id": "vandikkaran-magan-s025-d002",
    "scene_id": "vandikkaran-magan-s025",
    "scene_ordinal": 25,
    "source_scene_id": "20-எ",
    "source_heading": "காட்சி-20-எ",
    "speaker_label": "மரகதம்",
    "source_delimiter": ":—",
    "source_scene_file": "scene-025.md",
    "page_provenance": [
      {
        "pdf_page": 37,
        "printed_page": 36
      }
    ],
    "text": "விங்கனா? வர வேண்டிய நோய் வர வேண்டிய வயசிலே வந்தாச்சா?.."
  },
  {
    "id": "vandikkaran-magan-s025-d003",
    "scene_id": "vandikkaran-magan-s025",
    "scene_ordinal": 25,
    "source_scene_id": "20-எ",
    "source_heading": "காட்சி-20-எ",
    "speaker_label": "கோகிலா",
    "source_delimiter": ":—",
    "source_scene_file": "scene-025.md",
    "page_provenance": [
      {
        "pdf_page": 37,
        "printed_page": 36
      }
    ],
    "text": "(சட்டென) அம்மா! அந்தநோய் உங்களுக்கு எத்தன வயசுலம்மா வந்துச்சு?"
  },
  {
    "id": "vandikkaran-magan-s025-d004",
    "scene_id": "vandikkaran-magan-s025",
    "scene_ordinal": 25,
    "source_scene_id": "20-எ",
    "source_heading": "காட்சி-20-எ",
    "speaker_label": "மரகதம்",
    "source_delimiter": ":—",
    "source_scene_file": "scene-025.md",
    "page_provenance": [
      {
        "pdf_page": 37,
        "printed_page": 36
      }
    ],
    "text": "சீ! சரியான வெகுளிப் பெண்ணு வந்து பிறந்தேடி எனக்கு!..ஆமா...கோகிலா! என்ன விஷயம்..காதலா?"
  },
  {
    "id": "vandikkaran-magan-s025-d005",
    "scene_id": "vandikkaran-magan-s025",
    "scene_ordinal": 25,
    "source_scene_id": "20-எ",
    "source_heading": "காட்சி-20-எ",
    "speaker_label": "கோகிலா",
    "source_delimiter": ":—",
    "source_scene_file": "scene-025.md",
    "page_provenance": [
      {
        "pdf_page": 37,
        "printed_page": 36
      }
    ],
    "text": "அம்மா நீங்கதான் ஒரு ஜோசியம் சொல்லுங்களேன்! விங்கன் எனக்குக் கிடைப்பாரா? இல்லே, உமாவுக்குக் கிடைப்பாரா?"
  },
  {
    "id": "vandikkaran-magan-s025-d006",
    "scene_id": "vandikkaran-magan-s025",
    "scene_ordinal": 25,
    "source_scene_id": "20-எ",
    "source_heading": "காட்சி-20-எ",
    "speaker_label": "மரகதம்",
    "source_delimiter": ":—",
    "source_scene_file": "scene-025.md",
    "page_provenance": [
      {
        "pdf_page": 37,
        "printed_page": 36
      }
    ],
    "text": "ஓகோ! இதுவே போட்டிப் பந்தயம் வேறயா?"
  },
  {
    "id": "vandikkaran-magan-s025-d007",
    "scene_id": "vandikkaran-magan-s025",
    "scene_ordinal": 25,
    "source_scene_id": "20-எ",
    "source_heading": "காட்சி-20-எ",
    "speaker_label": "கோகிலா",
    "source_delimiter": ":—",
    "source_scene_file": "scene-025.md",
    "page_provenance": [
      {
        "pdf_page": 37,
        "printed_page": 36
      }
    ],
    "text": "ஆமாம்மா!..அவள் குடும்பத்துக்கு ஏத்த அந்தஸ்து இருந்தா உமா அவரைக் கல்யாணம் பண்ணிக்குவாளாம்..."
  },
  {
    "id": "vandikkaran-magan-s025-d008",
    "scene_id": "vandikkaran-magan-s025",
    "scene_ordinal": 25,
    "source_scene_id": "20-எ",
    "source_heading": "காட்சி-20-எ",
    "speaker_label": "மரகதம்",
    "source_delimiter": ":—",
    "source_scene_file": "scene-025.md",
    "page_provenance": [
      {
        "pdf_page": 37,
        "printed_page": 36
      }
    ],
    "text": "இல்லேன்னு, நீ தயார்னு சொன்னியாக்கும்..?"
  },
  {
    "id": "vandikkaran-magan-s025-d009",
    "scene_id": "vandikkaran-magan-s025",
    "scene_ordinal": 25,
    "source_scene_id": "20-எ",
    "source_heading": "காட்சி-20-எ",
    "speaker_label": "கோகிலா",
    "source_delimiter": ":—",
    "source_scene_file": "scene-025.md",
    "page_provenance": [
      {
        "pdf_page": 38,
        "printed_page": 37
      }
    ],
    "text": "சொல்லவேம்மா...நினைச்சிகிட்டிருக்கேன்!.."
  },
  {
    "id": "vandikkaran-magan-s025-d010",
    "scene_id": "vandikkaran-magan-s025",
    "scene_ordinal": 25,
    "source_scene_id": "20-எ",
    "source_heading": "காட்சி-20-எ",
    "speaker_label": "மரகதம்",
    "source_delimiter": ":—",
    "source_scene_file": "scene-025.md",
    "page_provenance": [
      {
        "pdf_page": 38,
        "printed_page": 37
      }
    ],
    "text": "நினைப்போட இருக்கட்டும் — ரொம்ப நெருங்கிடாதே!"
  },
  {
    "id": "vandikkaran-magan-s025-d011",
    "scene_id": "vandikkaran-magan-s025",
    "scene_ordinal": 25,
    "source_scene_id": "20-எ",
    "source_heading": "காட்சி-20-எ",
    "speaker_label": "கோகிலா",
    "source_delimiter": ":—",
    "source_scene_file": "scene-025.md",
    "page_provenance": [
      {
        "pdf_page": 38,
        "printed_page": 37
      }
    ],
    "text": "அம்மா! என் மனநிலையை எப்படிம்மா அப்படியே உங்கிட்ட சொல்ல முடியும்?.."
  },
  {
    "id": "vandikkaran-magan-s025-d012",
    "scene_id": "vandikkaran-magan-s025",
    "scene_ordinal": 25,
    "source_scene_id": "20-எ",
    "source_heading": "காட்சி-20-எ",
    "speaker_label": "மரகதம்",
    "source_delimiter": ":—",
    "source_scene_file": "scene-025.md",
    "page_provenance": [
      {
        "pdf_page": 38,
        "printed_page": 37
      }
    ],
    "text": "சொல்ல முடியலேன்னு விவரமா எழுதிக்கொடு!.."
  },
  {
    "id": "vandikkaran-magan-s025-d013",
    "scene_id": "vandikkaran-magan-s025",
    "scene_ordinal": 25,
    "source_scene_id": "20-எ",
    "source_heading": "காட்சி-20-எ",
    "speaker_label": "கோகிலா",
    "source_delimiter": ":—",
    "source_scene_file": "scene-025.md",
    "page_provenance": [
      {
        "pdf_page": 38,
        "printed_page": 37
      }
    ],
    "text": "அதைக் கொண்டு போயி, அவருகிட்ட கொடுத்திடறீங்களாம்மா!..."
  },
  {
    "id": "vandikkaran-magan-s025-d014",
    "scene_id": "vandikkaran-magan-s025",
    "scene_ordinal": 25,
    "source_scene_id": "20-எ",
    "source_heading": "காட்சி-20-எ",
    "speaker_label": "மரகதம்",
    "source_delimiter": ":—",
    "source_scene_file": "scene-025.md",
    "page_provenance": [
      {
        "pdf_page": 38,
        "printed_page": 37
      }
    ],
    "text": "நான் கொண்டு போய் கொடுக்கணுமா? அந்தக் காலத்திலே அன்னம் விடு தூதும்பாங்க!...இப்ப நீ அன்னம் விடு தூதே நடத்துறேங்கிறியா?..."
  },
  {
    "id": "vandikkaran-magan-s025-d015",
    "scene_id": "vandikkaran-magan-s025",
    "scene_ordinal": 25,
    "source_scene_id": "20-எ",
    "source_heading": "காட்சி-20-எ",
    "speaker_label": "கோகிலா",
    "source_delimiter": ":—",
    "source_scene_file": "scene-025.md",
    "page_provenance": [
      {
        "pdf_page": 38,
        "printed_page": 37
      }
    ],
    "text": "அம்மா! அப்படின்னு என் காதல்...என்னுறது?.."
  },
  {
    "id": "vandikkaran-magan-s025-d016",
    "scene_id": "vandikkaran-magan-s025",
    "scene_ordinal": 25,
    "source_scene_id": "20-எ",
    "source_heading": "காட்சி-20-எ",
    "speaker_label": "மரகதம்",
    "source_delimiter": ":—",
    "source_scene_file": "scene-025.md",
    "page_provenance": [
      {
        "pdf_page": 38,
        "printed_page": 37
      }
    ],
    "text": "கொஞ்ச நாளைக்கு ஊறுகாய்ப் பானையிலே போட்டு வை!...அது ஒண்ணும் ஊசிப் போயிடாது!.."
  },
  {
    "id": "vandikkaran-magan-s025-d017",
    "scene_id": "vandikkaran-magan-s025",
    "scene_ordinal": 25,
    "source_scene_id": "20-எ",
    "source_heading": "காட்சி-20-எ",
    "speaker_label": "கோகிலா",
    "source_delimiter": ":—",
    "source_scene_file": "scene-025.md",
    "page_provenance": [
      {
        "pdf_page": 38,
        "printed_page": 37
      }
    ],
    "text": "ஊறுகாய் போட்ட...என்ன மாங்காயா? எலுமிச்சங்காயா?..."
  },
  {
    "id": "vandikkaran-magan-s025-d018",
    "scene_id": "vandikkaran-magan-s025",
    "scene_ordinal": 25,
    "source_scene_id": "20-எ",
    "source_heading": "காட்சி-20-எ",
    "speaker_label": "மரகதம்",
    "source_delimiter": ":—",
    "source_scene_file": "scene-025.md",
    "page_provenance": [
      {
        "pdf_page": 38,
        "printed_page": 37
      }
    ],
    "text": "மாங்காய்க்கும், எலுமிச்சங்காய்க்கும் தேவை வந்துடக் கூடாதுன்னுதான்.. அவசரப்பட்டாதேங்கிறேன்!.."
  },
  {
    "id": "vandikkaran-magan-s025-d019",
    "scene_id": "vandikkaran-magan-s025",
    "scene_ordinal": 25,
    "source_scene_id": "20-எ",
    "source_heading": "காட்சி-20-எ",
    "speaker_label": "கோகிலா",
    "source_delimiter": ":—",
    "source_scene_file": "scene-025.md",
    "page_provenance": [
      {
        "pdf_page": 38,
        "printed_page": 37
      }
    ],
    "text": "சரிம்மா!...நீங்க அவரைப்பற்றி..."
  },
  {
    "id": "vandikkaran-magan-s025-d020",
    "scene_id": "vandikkaran-magan-s025",
    "scene_ordinal": 25,
    "source_scene_id": "20-எ",
    "source_heading": "காட்சி-20-எ",
    "speaker_label": "மரகதம்",
    "source_delimiter": ":—",
    "source_scene_file": "scene-025.md",
    "page_provenance": [
      {
        "pdf_page": 38,
        "printed_page": 37
      }
    ],
    "text": "ஆராய்ச்சியை ஆரம்பிக்கிறேன். அதுவரைக்கும் நீ கொஞ்சம் பொறுமையா இரு!.."
  }
]
